# BAM bridge configuration options
menu "BAM Bridge"

    config BAM_UART_BAUD
        int "Bridge UART baud rate"
        default 921600
        range 1200 3000000
        help
            Baud rate of the binary bridge protocol on UART0 (CH340K USB-UART,
            pins 43/44). The firmware always prints a boot banner at 115200
            first, then switches to this baud. Monitor the bridge with:

                idf.py monitor --monitor-baud <this value>

            and open the host driver (tools/bam_bridge.py) at the same baud.

endmenu
